(6792894, 1019081, 30982, '<td valign="top">Oh I like this.  My kind of picture.  Normal, everyday oddities.  Now if the car had only been an old beat up wood-sided station wagon... :-)  Still, great choice for the challenge.</td>', 'Oh I like this.  My kind of picture.  Normal, everyday oddities.  Now if the car had only been an old beat up wood-sided station wagon... :-)  Still, great choice for the challenge.', '2012-06-12 02:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
