(6793228, 1019968, 86447, '<td valign="top">Ha!   I love this idea!    I wish the brush were pointed toward where he''s just been painting... would make a better story, I think.<br/> <br/>If he were shot closer to the painting, then it would be more engaging, I think... there''s so much negative space that''s wasted, I fear...<br/> <br/> <br/>Also, it all seems a bit... drab... the colors need boosting... or maybe apply some Curves for POP!  ?<br/> <br/>I''m not being critical, although it sounds like it.  I really like the image and the idea... or I wouldn''t have spent time analyzing it for so long.  :D<br/> <br/>(commenting only)</td>', 'Ha!   I love this idea!    I wish the brush were pointed toward where he''s just been painting... would make a better story, I think. If he were shot closer to the painting, then it would be more engaging, I think... there''s so much negative space that''s wasted, I fear...  Also, it all seems a bit... drab... the colors need boosting... or maybe apply some Curves for POP!  ? I''m not being critical, although it sounds like it.  I really like the image and the idea... or I wouldn''t have spent time analyzing it for so long.  :D (commenting only)', '2012-06-12 18:09:16.000000', NULL, 1),
