(6793484, 1019694, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice natural light - I like the touch of mist along the base of the trees.</td>', 'Nice natural light - I like the touch of mist along the base of the trees.', '2012-06-13 00:41:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6793485, 1018813, 30982, '<td valign="top">That bird must really trust you, since you''re probably right next to it!</td>', 'That bird must really trust you, since you''re probably right next to it!', '2012-06-13 00:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6793486, 1019949, 30982, '<td valign="top">A very nice use of wide, in my opinion.  Daydreaming while driving - happens all the time.  An empty highway is most definitely a dream!</td>', 'A very nice use of wide, in my opinion.  Daydreaming while driving - happens all the time.  An empty highway is most definitely a dream!', '2012-06-13 00:43:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6793487, 1019825, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice marine layer!</td>', 'Nice marine layer!', '2012-06-13 00:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6793488, 1020145, 30982, '<td valign="top">Love the way the tree looms over and seems to be keeping watch, like a sentinel.  Great clouds, excellent exposure to keep the detail in them.</td>', 'Love the way the tree looms over and seems to be keeping watch, like a sentinel.  Great clouds, excellent exposure to keep the detail in them.', '2012-06-13 00:43:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6793489, 1020055, 30982, '<td valign="top">Feels like you''ve got your spy periscope out and you''re trying to check up on your reclusive neighbors!  I''m guessing a filter gave you the edge and the dark sky.  Interesting choices and a nice way to work with minimal!</td>', 'Feels like you''ve got your spy periscope out and you''re trying to check up on your reclusive neighbors!  I''m guessing a filter gave you the edge and the dark sky.  Interesting choices and a nice way to work with minimal!', '2012-06-13 00:45:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6793490, 1019533, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice choice of location to show off "wide".</td>', 'Nice choice of location to show off "wide".', '2012-06-13 00:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6793491, 1019021, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very elegant - if this is BEHIND downtown, then downtown must be really ritzy!</td>', 'Very elegant - if this is BEHIND downtown, then downtown must be really ritzy!', '2012-06-13 00:45:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6793494, 1019839, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the fisheye here - makes the space seem far more generous than it probably really is and lets us see more of the activity.</td>', 'I like the fisheye here - makes the space seem far more generous than it probably really is and lets us see more of the activity.', '2012-06-13 00:46:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6793496, 1019835, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice golden light.  Peaceful and warm.</td>', 'Nice golden light.  Peaceful and warm.', '2012-06-13 00:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6793497, 1019434, 30982, '<td valign="top">A tad bright, probably due to time of day, but I like that touch of red of the bridge amidst the green.</td>', 'A tad bright, probably due to time of day, but I like that touch of red of the bridge amidst the green.', '2012-06-13 00:47:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6793498, 1019890, 30982, '<td valign="top">The nice thing about minimal is you get the lovely grays that are real, like here.  Stark, barren, windswept, all done nicely in gray.</td>', 'The nice thing about minimal is you get the lovely grays that are real, like here.  Stark, barren, windswept, all done nicely in gray.', '2012-06-13 00:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6793504, 1019825, 4793, '<td valign="top">Beautiful</td>', 'Beautiful', '2012-06-13 00:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6793506, 1019114, 4793, '<td valign="top">Nice</td>', 'Nice', '2012-06-13 00:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6793543, 1019306, 30982, '<td valign="top">Wide in both perspective and content in that it spans the river.</td>', 'Wide in both perspective and content in that it spans the river.', '2012-06-13 01:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6793544, 1020133, 30982, '<td valign="top">Ha!  A fun evening-out kinda shot!</td>', 'Ha!  A fun evening-out kinda shot!', '2012-06-13 01:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6793549, 1019997, 30982, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  Great light, excellent composition, stunning landscape AND a gorgeous dog.</td>', 'Beautiful.  Great light, excellent composition, stunning landscape AND a gorgeous dog.', '2012-06-13 01:11:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6793551, 1019883, 30982, '<td valign="top">Ha!  Nice use of the fisheye mirror!  I also like the repeating circles of the manhole covers.</td>', 'Ha!  Nice use of the fisheye mirror!  I also like the repeating circles of the manhole covers.', '2012-06-13 01:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6793553, 1019467, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nice leading lines!  Great light ont he hills beyond, too, to show off the green.</td>', 'Very nice leading lines!  Great light ont he hills beyond, too, to show off the green.', '2012-06-13 01:12:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6793557, 1019991, 30982, '<td valign="top">Ha!  Nice use of a bit of distortion with the lens AND your model.</td>', 'Ha!  Nice use of a bit of distortion with the lens AND your model.', '2012-06-13 01:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6793559, 1019996, 30982, '<td valign="top">A fine canopy it provides, letting in just enough sunlight to brighten the green of its leaves.</td>', 'A fine canopy it provides, letting in just enough sunlight to brighten the green of its leaves.', '2012-06-13 01:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6793562, 1020066, 30982, '<td valign="top">The repetition is almost hypnotic in a way.</td>', 'The repetition is almost hypnotic in a way.', '2012-06-13 01:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6793566, 1018821, 30982, '<td valign="top">Heh!  Basketball from a small child''s perspective.  Makes for a nice geometric!</td>', 'Heh!  Basketball from a small child''s perspective.  Makes for a nice geometric!', '2012-06-13 01:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6793569, 1019965, 30982, '<td valign="top">Definitely a wide world to that little guy.  Well seen.</td>', 'Definitely a wide world to that little guy.  Well seen.', '2012-06-13 01:14:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6793571, 1020046, 30982, '<td valign="top">Denver gets some awesome lighting shows!</td>', 'Denver gets some awesome lighting shows!', '2012-06-13 01:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6793572, 1018923, 30982, '<td valign="top">Wonderful sky and clouds for this view.  Nicely done in camera exposure and color!</td>', 'Wonderful sky and clouds for this view.  Nicely done in camera exposure and color!', '2012-06-13 01:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6793671, 1020092, 86447, '<td valign="top">I think I like this one better than the Dead End one.<br/> <br/>Maybe even more so, if the jar were shot on the thirds... a bit to the left.<br/> <br/>I like this!<br/> <br/>(commenting only)<br/> <br/>ETA: I don''t think you''ll beat your other placement... but I still like this one best.  :)</td>', 'I think I like this one better than the Dead End one. Maybe even more so, if the jar were shot on the thirds... a bit to the left. I like this! (commenting only) ETA: I don''t think you''ll beat your other placement... but I still like this one best.  :)', '2012-06-13 01:48:49.000000', NULL, 1),
